//orator
"whitaker_nags04.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Perhaps I should have mentioned this bein' a limited time offer.
"whitaker_nags05.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: You folks wanna get a move on?
"whitaker_nags06.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I'm getting mighty thirsty up here...
"whitaker_nags07.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Any time now...
"whitaker_nags08.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Throat... so dry... can't think straight... must... rescind offer... to these lazy people...
"whitaker_wayblocked01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: My name's Whitaker. I own this gun shop.
"whitaker_wayblocked02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I'm guessing you four'd be heading to the mall for rescue. I also know the road is blocked. But I can clear it for you, in exchange for you running over to the store next door and picking me up some colas.
"whitaker_wayblocked03.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I'm in need of some colas. You four run over there and procure some for me, and I'll clear the roadblock to the mall. Because I'm that's where you're headed, and you ain't getting there without my help.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongera01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I'm guessing you four'd be heading to the mall for rescue.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongera02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: And I further guess you won't get there, as the road is blocked.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongera03.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I know because I watched CEDA block it.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongera04.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: So here's what I propose.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongerb01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I'm guessing you four'd be heading to the evacuation center in the mall.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongerb02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I also guess you're gonna have a hell of time doing it, seeing as how those government fools blockaded the road getting there.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongerb03.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: So here's what I propose.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongerc01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I've barricaded myself on the roof, with provisions and guns enough to and kill every zombie in the city five times over, and eat well while I'm doing it.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongerc02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: But in my haste I forgot to pack cola.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongerd01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Cola and nuts is a weakness of mine-though I do not love it so much that I'd be fool enough to die in the attempt to procure it.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongere01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I've barricaded myself on the roof with ample provisions.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongere02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: But in my haste I forgot cola.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongerf01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: So here is my proposition: If you go find me some cola at yonder food store, I'll clear a path to the mall for you.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongerg01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: So here is my proposition: If you go find me some cola at yonder food store, I'll clear that CEDA blockade for you.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongerh01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: If you get me my cola, I'll get you to the mall.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongeri01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I'd be able to help you get to the mall, if I wasn't so parched from thirst.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongerj01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Now, I have the nuts. I just need cola.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongerj02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: So the matter on the table is: do you four have the nuts to get me this cola?
"whitaker_wayblockedlongerk01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I'll be blunt.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongerk02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I need cola and I won't let you through the barricade until I get it.
"whitaker_wayblockedlongerk03.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Now go.
