"whitaker_comeupstairs01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Well, hello there. Why don't you grab yourselves some of my guns and come on upstairs. I got something you can help me with.
"whitaker_comeupstairs02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Hello there. My name's Whitaker. I own this establishment. Take anything you need and come on upstairs when you're done.
"whitaker_comeupstairs03.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: There ain't much time. Grab yourselves a gun and come upstairs, I'll explain on the way.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongera01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Well, now. This might just work out after all.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongera02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Help yourself to the weapons. Take anything you need.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongera03.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I'm in a bit of a quandary, you see, and I suspect you're just the people to help me out of it.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongera04.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Come on upstairs when you're done.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerb01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Well, now. This might just work out after all.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerb02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Help yourself to MY weapons.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerb03.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Take anything you need. I'm in a bit of a quandary, you see, and...
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerb04.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: GET YOUR HANDS OFF MY STORE YOU SON OF A BITCH.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerb05.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: and I suspect you're just the people to help me out of it.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerb06.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Come on upstairs when you're done.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerc01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Hello there. Now, normally when four bloodstained looters break into my store, I would shoot them where they stand.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerc02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: But you happen to have caught me at an opportune time.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerc03.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Take what weapons you need and come on upstairs. I reckon we can come to an accordance.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerd01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Hello there.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerd02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Now, normally when four bloodstained looters break into my store, I would shoot them where they stand.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerd03.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: But you happen to have caught me at...
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerd04.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: get your hands off my store.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerd05.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: caught me at an opportune time.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerd06.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Take what weapons you need and come on upstairs. I reckon...
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerd07.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Climb that, you green-skinned sonofabitch.
"whitaker_comeupstairslongerd08.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: reckon we can come to an accordance.
"whitaker_conversation01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: You could try. I own a LOT of guns, son.
"whitaker_conversation02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Not only will I help you get to the mall, I'll even throw in the guns you stole from me, free of charge.
"whitaker_conversation03.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I am a man of my word, sir. Procure my colas and I'll clear a path to the mall for you. The guns are on the house.
"whitaker_conversation04.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Procure my colas and my help is guaranteed, sir. Consider the guns a generous donation to the cause.
"whitaker_conversation05.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I am not a man to weasel out of a deal. I'd shake on it with you, but there's no way in hell I'm going back down there.
"whitaker_conversation06.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I been on this world sixty years, ma'am, and I've weaseled nothing from nobody. You got my word as a gentleman.
"whitaker_conversation07.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I'm a man of my word, ma'am. You got my word on that.
"whitaker_conversation08.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: On my word as a gentleman I will do no screwing, sir. I'd come down there and shake on it, but I already welded the door shut.
"whitaker_conversation09.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Cola, ma'am. For my cola and nuts.
"whitaker_conversation10.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: And how fortuitous that we do, else which you would have nothing to bargain with, and no way to the mall.
"whitaker_conversation11.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: No, sir. Diet don't get the right flavor. I better not see no cherry neither. It's straight cola or no deal.
"whitaker_conversation12.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: If they can be of service to you in your endeavor, please keep them.
"whitaker_conversation13.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Only your promise that you'll put them to good use.
"whitaker_conversation14.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Only your promise that you'll put them to good use. And, as I mentioned, the colas.
"whitaker_conversation15.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: No thank you, ma'am. I have five restaurant-sized boxes of them up here.
"whitaker_conversation16.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Those ARE my terms, sir.
"whitaker_conversation17.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Then I'm willing to let you keep it, son. Hell, I'll even cover you once you get outside.
"whitaker_conversation18.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Then it's all yours, girl. Hell, I'll even cover you once you get outside.
"whitaker_conversation19.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I like a woman who appreciates the subtle perfection of a well made firearm.
"whitaker_defendchatter01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: There's the alarm! Now go!
"whitaker_defendchatter02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: That's the alarm! Move, now, move!
"whitaker_defendchatter03.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: There's the alarm! GO! I'll cover you!
"whitaker_defendchatter04.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I'll cover you! Go get what I need!
"whitaker_defendchatter05.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Come on now, move! I'll help where I can!
"whitaker_defendchatter06.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Back, you creatures!
"whitaker_defendchatter07.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I'll cover you! Go!
"whitaker_defendchatter08.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Remember the cola! Leave a man behind if you must, but get the cola!
"whitaker_defendchatter09.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Sacrifice yourselves if you have to! The cola is that important!
"whitaker_defendchatter10.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Leave the girl behind, just get the cola!
"whitaker_defendchatter11.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Leave the little fella, just get the cola!
"whitaker_defendchatter12.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Leave white suit behind, just get the cola!
"whitaker_defendchatter13.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Forget the fat man, just get the cola!
"whitaker_defendchatter14.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Here they come!
"whitaker_defendchatter15.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Awww, hell. Here they come. It was nice knowin' you.
"whitaker_defendchatter16.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Awww, hell. Here they come. It was nice knowin' you.
"whitaker_defendchatter17.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Damn, that's a lot of zombies. If they kill you, don't worry! I don't need the cola that bad!
"whitaker_defendchatter18.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Back, ya sons of bitches! Let 'em through!
"whitaker_defendchatter19.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Ohhh, hell. I regret this agreement already. What a waste of guns.
"whitaker_missioncompleted01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Put the cola in the slot.
"whitaker_missioncompleted02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Put the cola in the slot.
"whitaker_missioncompleted03.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: You got the cola. Put it in the slot.
"whitaker_missioncompleted04.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: There's my cola. Quick, put it in the slot.
"whitaker_missioncompleted05.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Yeah, put it in the damn slot.
"whitaker_missioncompleted06.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Thank you kindly. And to prove I'm a man of my word...
"whitaker_missioncompleted07.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Thank you for that! Now, turn around. Y'all ever see a tanker explode?
"whitaker_missioncompleted08.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Just a six-pack? I'll go through that in a day! Ahh, hell. A deal's a deal. Here y'are...
"whitaker_missioncompleted09.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I'll take you at your word that ain't diet. Cover your ears, this might get loud...
"whitaker_missioncompleted10.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Thank you, generous strangers! Let me get rid of that barricade for you.
"whitaker_missioncompleted11.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Much obliged. Now go screw yourselves, I ain't helpin'. [laughs] I just wanted to see the looks on your faces. Here you go.
"whitaker_missioncompleted12.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Much obliged. Now go screw yourselves, I ain't helpin'. [laughs] I just wanted to see the looks on your faces. Here you go.
"whitaker_missioncompleted13.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Hey, put the cola in the slot.
"whitaker_missioncompleted14.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Put the cola in the slot, will ya?
"whitaker_missioncompleted15.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Okay, that's my cola. Yes, yes. Put it in the slot!
"whitaker_missioncompleted16.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Good luck now!
"whitaker_missioncompleted17.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Good luck now!
"whitaker_missioncompleted18.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Best of luck! Take care of those guns!
"whitaker_missioncompleted19.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Good luck to you.
"whitaker_missioncompleted20.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Good luck to you, gang.
"whitaker_missioncompleted21.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: God watch over you.
"whitaker_missioncompleted22.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Good luck gettin' to that mall.
"whitaker_missioncompleted23.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Good luck gettin' to that mall.
"whitaker_nags01.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: I didn't realize you'd need this much preparation. Can I bring y'all a pillow and blankets while you sleep on it?
"whitaker_nags02.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: You folks best hurry before I change my mind.
"whitaker_nags03.vcd",//<clr:128,140,148>Whitaker: Y'all don't get moving, I might just rescind my generous offer. I got a hell of a view up here to watch y'all die.
//orator_chopper
"soldier2_chatter01.vcd",//<clr:148,130,130>Soldier 2: This is Rescue 7. Over.
"soldier2_chatter02.vcd",//<clr:148,130,130>Soldier 2: This is Rescue 7. Over.
