"soldier2_chatter04.vcd",//<clr:148,130,130>Soldier 2: Ten minutes. Over.
"soldier2_chatter05.vcd",//<clr:148,130,130>Soldier 2: Roger, Papa Gator. Fifteen minutes. Ah, be advised we have seen flashes on the west bank. Ah, visually confirm west bank is clear. Over.
"soldier2_chatter06.vcd",//<clr:148,130,130>Soldier 2: Negative. We are seeing something. Over.
"soldier2_chatter07.vcd",//<clr:148,130,130>Soldier 2: Ahh, unclear.
"soldier2_chatter08.vcd",//<clr:148,130,130>Soldier 2: Ahh, unclear. It-
"soldier2_chatter09.vcd",//<clr:148,130,130>Soldier 2: Papa Gator, we're not sure. We are seeing, ah, multiple personnel and small arms fire. What is our current ROE? Over.
"soldier2_chatter10.vcd",//<clr:148,130,130>Soldier 2: Roger, Papa Gator. All personnel on floating LZ. Clear for last Buzzard run. Over.
