"soldier2_nags01.vcd",//<clr:148,130,130>Soldier 2: Copy that, Papa Gator. Over.
"soldier2_nags02.vcd",//<clr:148,130,130>Soldier 2: Ah, negative, Papa Gator. You are not good to go. We will advise when ready. Over.
"soldier2_nags03.vcd",//<clr:148,130,130>Soldier 2: Copy that, Papa Gator. Over.
"soldier2_survivortalk01.vcd",//<clr:148,130,130>Soldier 2: Last Buzzard, stand down! Stand down!
"soldier2_survivortalk02.vcd",//<clr:148,130,130>Soldier 2: Affirmative, Papa Gator.
