// orator_farm_radio
"soldier_radiobutton109.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: Jesus Christ. Captain, we got somebody alive out there!
"soldier_radiobutton110.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: Jesus Christ. Captain, we got survivors. They say they're cops!
"soldier_radiobutton113.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: We read you loud and clear, survivors! We are prepping an extraction team. Prepare yourselves and radio back when you're ready.
"soldier_radiobutton201.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: Read you loud and clear! Get ready, we're on our way!
"soldier_radiobutton202.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: We are prepped and good to go. Advise when ready!
"soldier_radiobutton205.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: We read you just fine. We're on our way.
"soldier_radiobutton206.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: Roger that, survivors. We are on our way.
"soldier_radiobutton207.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: Roger, survivors, we are go. ETA in ten minutes.
"soldier_radiobutton208.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: That is a go, survivors. Be advised it will take us ten minutes to reach you.
"soldier_radiobutton209.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: Copy that, survivors. It'll take us a good ten minutes to reach you. Dig in and hold on, you got me?
"soldier_radiobutton210.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: Copy that, survivors. We're coming for you! Hang on!
"soldier_radioinitialbroadcast01.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: This is an emergency broadcast from the American Safety Zone. Please respond.
"soldier_radioinitialbroadcast06.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: This is an emergency broadcast from the US Military. Please respond.
"soldier_radionag01.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: Please advise when ready!
"soldier_radionag02.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: Please advise when ready.
"soldier_radiobutton101.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: Holy shit. Captain, someone actually responded!
"soldier_radiobutton105.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: We'll come get you! Convoy's gonna stir up the infected, though. Prepare yourselves and advise when ready, over.
"soldier_radiobutton108.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: I do not believe it. Captain, somebody's survived out there!
"soldier_radioinitialbroadcast05.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: You are listening to an emergency broadcast from the US Military. If you can hear this, please use the microphone while pressing the SEND button immediately.
"soldier_radiointransit01.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: Be advised, we are approximately eight minutes to target.
"soldier_radiointransit02.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Soldier: Hey there, survivors, we're still a good eight minutes out. Sit tight. We are coming.
//orator_boat_radio
"boatman_radioarrived01.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: All aboard, folks!
"boatman_radioarrived02.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Get in! Get in!
"boatman_radioarrived03.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: We ain't got all day, let's do this already!
"boatman_radioarrived06.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Come on, come on! We're not waiting around here all day!
"boatman_radioarrived07.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Let's go, we're here, we're here! Come on!
"boatman_radioarrived08.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: The boat's here! Hello?!? Get in the boat!
"boatman_radiobutton108.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: They're gonna swarm when we come in. Stock up and radio back when you're ready.
"boatman_radiobutton110.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: We're heading to the military outpost upriver. We can come get you in ten minutes. Arm yourselves for the trip and tell me when to head out.
"boatman_radiobutton111.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Hello? Hello!
"boatman_radiobutton123.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Hello? Honey, it's the police!
"boatman_radiobutton124.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: POLICE, RADIO US BACK WHEN YOU ARE READY FOR PICKUP!
"boatman_radiobutton201.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Perfect.
"boatman_radiobutton205.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: We'll be there in ten minutes.
"boatman_radiobutton207.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Alright, we're on our way.
"boatman_radiobutton212.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Allright, we're on our way. Make sure you clear the area. I don't want our first act of kindness to be our last.
"boatman_radioinitialbroadcast02.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: If there is anyone out there. This is John and Amanda Slater. We are a small fishing vessel anchored off Riverside.
"boatman_radioinitialbroadcast03.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: If there are any survivors, please respond.
"boatman_radioinitialbroadcast05.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: If you can hear me, please respond!
"boatman_radioinitialbroadcast07.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Is there anybody out there?
"boatman_radioinitialbroadcast08.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: John and Amanda Slater! We are a fishing vessel anchored off Riverside! Come in please!
"boatman_radioinitialbroadcast09.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Come in, refugees! If you can hear this.
"boatman_radioinitialbroadcast11.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Anybody? Come on, please respond.
"boatman_radioinitialbroadcast12.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: We have provisions and a route to safety. We just need to get there alive. Anyone with firepower, respond.
"boatman_radioinitialbroadcast13.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: We will ferry anyone with firearms and ammo. Please respond.
"boatman_radioinitialbroadcast14.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: We are anchored off Riverside. Anyone on this frequency with weapons and ammo, please respond.
"boatman_radioinitialbroadcast15.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Attention anyone with ammo and firearms. If you can hear me, please respond.
"boatman_radioinitialbroadcast16.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Anyone with some firepower on this frequency, pick up.
"boatman_radioinitialbroadcast17.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Come in, anyone armed. Please pick up.
"boatman_radioinitialbroadcast18.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: If you can hear me, pick up!
"boatman_radioinitialbroadcast19.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: If you're out there and you're armed, pick up!
"boatman_radiointransit01.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Should be there in ten minutes!
"boatman_radiointransit03.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Be there in about five minutes!
"boatman_radiointransit06.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: We'll be there in two minutes!
"boatman_radiointransit07.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: We'll be there in three minutes!
"boatman_radiointransit08.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: We can see the shore! We're coming.
"boatman_radionag01.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Tell us when you are ready to be picked up!
"boatman_radionag02.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Let us know when you're ready to be picked up!
"boatman_radionag03.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Tell us when you are ready to be picked up!
"boatman_radionag04.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Let us know when you're ready to be picked up!
"boatman_radionag05.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Use the radio to let us know when you're ready for pickup!
"boatman_radionag07.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>John Slater: Police: Let us know when you're ready to be picked up.
// churchguy
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended03.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Nonono! You said that last time! You said that last time. I trusted you last time!
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended07.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Really?
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended10.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Only when you can prove you're immune. And I know just how to do it. [Bell]
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended11.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Only when I know you're human. Get ready for the test. [Bell]
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended12.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I'm the one who decides who gets through this door.
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended13.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I - I opened the door before, and I got bit for my trouble. [Bell] Better safe than sorry. Better safe than sorry!
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended16.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Do you think I care how old you are?
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended18.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: NO!
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended19.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: You think you're special with your leather jackets and your fancy blood?
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended20.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Nobody rides for free! Ding dong!
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended21.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I am not a mental moron!
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended23.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Can you really? [Bell]
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended25.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: You don't sound like cops!
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended28.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Your word means shit to me! [Bell]
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended31.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Trying to intimidate me? [Bell] Didn't help.
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended32.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Well, you'll have to be alive to do that. [Bell]
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended34.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I'm not letting you in until I'm sure you're immune.
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended35.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Not infected? Not infected? Prove it! [Bell]
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended40.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Ding dong! Ding dong!
"churchguy_radiobutton1extended43.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Dinner's served! Come and get it!
"churchguy_radiobutton101.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: No one gets in here until I know you're immune!
"churchguy_radiobutton105.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I'm gonna ring this bell. I'm going to ring this bell! And they'll come! And they'll finish the job.
"churchguy_radiobutton106.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: No! My safehouse! I've got the bell! You stay the hell out!
"churchguy_radiobutton107.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: My safehouse! Come here! No! Stay out! Slide your guns under the door! No! Go away! Better safe than sorry! Better safe than sorry! Better safe than sorry!
"churchguy_radiobutton109.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: No one gets in! [Bell]
"churchguy_radiobutton110.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Go away! No one gets in!
"churchguy_radiobutton113.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I can make you leave. Don't believe me? [Bell]
"churchguy_radiobutton114.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: HOW ABOUT NOW?
"churchguy_radiocombatcolor01.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I can't believe he bit me. Better safe than - [groan] Better safe than [groan] [choke]
"churchguy_radiocombatcolor02.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Better safe than - [growl] Better safe than [growl]
"churchguy_radiocombatcolor03.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Better safe than - [growl]
"churchguy_radiocombatcolor04.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: [choking growl]
"churchguy_radiocombatcolor05.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Must be immune - [groan] Must be immune [scream]
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast01.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I trusted you. You said you were immune. You said you were immune.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast02.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I trusted you. You said you were immune. You said you were immune. Better safe than sorry.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast03.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Better safe than sorry. I can't believe he bit me. Never should have let him in. Can't believe he bit me.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast04.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Won't fool me twice. I can't believe he bit me, I can't believe he bit me.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast05.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Better safe than sorry. No matter how human they look. Won't be fooled twice.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast06.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: It's been an hour. Been an hour. Must be immune. That's right, must be immune. No. I have to be immune.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast07.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Better safe than sorry. Better safe than sorry. Better safe than sorry. Better safe than sorry.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast08.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Better safe than sorry.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast09.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I can't believe he bit me. I never should have let him in. I can't believe he bit me.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast10.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Won't fool me twice. I can't believe he bit me! Better safe than sorry.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast11.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Don't get fooled twice. Don't get fooled twice. Better safe than sorry.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast12.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I can't believe he bit me, that's - Don't get fooled twice.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast13.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Who's there?
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast14.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Is someone there?
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast15.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Don't make me use this bell!
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast16.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I've got a bell in here!
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast17.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I'm gonna start ringin' this church bell if you don't say something.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast18.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: What's going on out there!
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast20.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I can hear you out there!
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast22.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I heard that!
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast24.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Better safe than sorry. Better safe than sorry.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast26.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Better safe than sorry. Better safe than sorry. Better safe than sorry.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast27.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Better safe than sorry. Better safe than sorry. Better safe than sorry. [cough]
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast28.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: I can't believe he bit me. I never should have let him in. I can't believe he bit me.
"churchguy_radioinitialbroadcast29.vcd",//<I><clr:237,201,87>Church Guy: Better safe than sorry.
/// orator_plane_radio
"planepilot_radioarrived01.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Pilot: All right, we're fueled up! Get in!
"planepilot_radioarrived10.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Pilot: What're you waitin' for, your row to be called? Get in!
"planepilot_radiobutton104.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Pilot: The pump's gonna make a real racket. So you make sure you're ready for a fight before you start 'er up.
"planepilot_radiobutton105.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Pilot: All right! Gas me up, and we can fly out of here!
"planepilot_radiobutton203.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Pilot: That did it! I can hear the truck pumpin'!
"planepilot_radiobutton205.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Pilot: Hold 'em off for me while I fuel up!
"planepilot_radiocombatcolor08.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Pilot: You're doing great!
"planepilot_radiocombatcolor28.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Pilot: More comin'. Look alive.
"planepilot_radiocombatcolor29.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Pilot: Look out! More on the way!
"planepilot_radioinitialbroadcast06.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Pilot: Hey! You there! Y'all wanna get me fueled up?
"planepilot_radioinitialbroadcast07.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Pilot: Hey there! Don't suppose y'all wanna gas me up?
"planepilot_radioinitialbroadcast09.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Pilot: Hey! You there! Gas me up, I'll getcha outta here!
"planepilot_radioinitialbroadcast10.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Pilot: I get fuelled up, I can git goin here! Come on, you folks with me?
"planepilot_radioinitialbroadcast18.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Pilot: You! Yes you! Come talk to me on the radio!
"planepilot_radiointransit01.vcd",//<I><clr:26,125,194>Pilot: Gas tank's a quarter full! Sorry, guys, still a ways yet!
