"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoom03.vcd",//Ellis: Hey, there's a dry saferoom up here!
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoom04.vcd",//Ellis: Dry saferoom up here!
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoom05.vcd",//Ellis: Oh, we are getting close, man, I can feel her. I mean the car.
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo01.vcd",//Ellis: Nick, for the last time, I am NOT leaving it behind.
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo02.vcd",//Ellis: We gotta find a way to get that bridge up, no way I'm leaving that car behind.
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo03.vcd",//Ellis: JUST A CAR!?!? JUST A CAR!?!?! That's like saying the Mona Lisa's just a sculpture, or shit, that's like sayin' Jimmy Gibb's just a driver. That's like saying that girl on the bridge is just a little pretty, she's an angel. Shit, that's like, that's like, shit I don't know THAT'S JIMMY GIBBS' CAR!
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo04.vcd",//Ellis: Screw this I just can't leave that car behind. I'm going back for her.
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo05.vcd",//Ellis: Hey, Rochelle, now don't spare my feelings none, do you think I got any shot with that Zoey girl?
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo06.vcd",//Ellis: I was just thinkin' of her, Nick. Man, she is beautiful.
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo07.vcd",//Ellis: Yeah, I was just thinkin' of her too, Nick. Oh, she is beautiful.
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo08.vcd",//Ellis: Get outta here! All right!
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo09.vcd",//Ellis: Oh, I keep hoping we drive to a place where there aren't any more zombies.
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo10.vcd",//Ellis: You know, we've been gone for a while, you think the car is okay?
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo11.vcd",//Ellis: Yeah, yeah, that's not going to happen.
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo12.vcd",//Ellis: Okay, Ro. Whatever you say.
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo13.vcd",//Ellis: Okay, Coach. Whatever you say.
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo14.vcd",//Ellis: Ro, that car's family now. Hell, that biker fella's an awesome dude, but we ain't tradin' him for Nick.
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo15.vcd",//Ellis: Ah man, that Zoey will never go for a man like me.
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo16.vcd",//Ellis: Oh, Ro, man, that reminds me of this...
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo17.vcd",//Ellis: Yeah. It's been hell, all right.
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo18.vcd",//Ellis: Not if we get that bridge down. We'll be drivin' the Jimmy Gibbs Junior all the way to New Orleans!
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo19.vcd",//Ellis: Well, maybe if we find a nice open stretch, we slow down, and you can jog right alongside. Like in that boxing movie!
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo20.vcd",//Ellis: Oh dude, this reminds me of that time, my buddy Keith? He went on a diet, on account of what his doctor sayin' he had to go on a diet, or he'd die? So they told him he could drink nothin' but them little diet shakes, but those are like five bucks a can, ll make my own damn smoothies!' He got himself a blender, all sorts of salad shit, kiwis, limes, some tequila, a big can of that protein powder the bodybuilders use...
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo21.vcd",//Ellis: Naw, he gained like thirty pounds. But he invented a shitload of tasty drinks. I was always partial to Keith's Kiwi Kamikaze.
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo22.vcd",//Ellis: Man, if you woulda told me a year ago that I'd be driving around in JIMMY GIBBS JUNIOR'S stock car, I wouldn't have BELIEVED you. It is like... just beyond, man.
"mechanic/dlc1_c6m2_saferoomconvo23.vcd",//Ellis: Yeah, no, I seen my share of horror movies.
