"producer/worldc1m1b08.vcd",//Rochelle: I AM NOT-I am NOT loud.
"producer/worldc1m1b09.vcd",//Rochelle: Guys, now's not the time for a pissing contest. The building's on fire. Let's get off this roof while we still can.
"producer/worldc1m1b10.vcd",//Rochelle: Good enough for me. Let's grab some weapons and get out of here.
"producer/worldc1m1b11.vcd",//Rochelle: Mall it is. But first, let's grab something to defend ourselves with.
"producer/worldc1m1b12.vcd",//Rochelle: Sounds good. Let's grab some weapons and get the hell out of here.
"producer/worldc1m1b13.vcd",//Rochelle: I can't believe I'm stranded in Savannah.
"producer/worldc1m1b14.vcd",//Rochelle: Oh please God, don't you let me die in Georgia.
"producer/worldc1m1b15.vcd",//Rochelle: Oh shit, they did NOT just leave us on this roof!
"producer/worldc1m1b16.vcd",//Rochelle: Oh shit, they did NOT just leave us here!
"producer/worldc1m1b17.vcd",//Rochelle: Oh, I think there's an evac station in the mall.
"producer/worldc1m1b19.vcd",//Rochelle: I been hearing about…things. You know what, never mind. But grab a weapon, trust me.
"producer/worldc1m1b20.vcd",//Rochelle: I think those things are down there, grab a weapon.
"producer/worldc1m1b21.vcd",//Rochelle: If we stay together and keep our heads, we can get out of this.
"producer/worldc1m1b22.vcd",//Rochelle: Oh, you meeting some other friends?
"producer/worldc1m1b23.vcd",//Rochelle: We ain't got time for this, people! Grab a weapon and let's get to this mall.
"producer/worldc1m1b24.vcd",//Rochelle: I hope you're wrong but I know you're not.
"producer/worldc1m1b25.vcd",//Rochelle: Do I LOOK like I'm packing a gun?
"producer/worldc1m1b26.vcd",//Rochelle: I'm not the gun-packing type.
"producer/worldc1m1b27.vcd",//Rochelle: We should take some weapons. I work in the news and the news says we should definitely take some weapons.
"producer/worldc1m1b28.vcd",//Rochelle: I don't know, since this all seems to be true, trust me, when I say we should grab any weapon we can find.
"producer/worldc1m1b29.vcd",//Rochelle: We should take something to protect ourselves.
"producer/worldc1m1b30.vcd",//Rochelle: All right, sounds like a plan.
"producer/worldc1m1b31.vcd",//Rochelle: I agree.
"producer/worldc1m1b32.vcd",//Rochelle: That's a good point.
"producer/worldc1m1b33.vcd",//Rochelle: Right, so?
"producer/worldc1m1b34.vcd",//Rochelle: I'm gonna have to agree.
"producer/worldc1m1b35.vcd",//Rochelle: Okay, this man's talking some sense. Let's get out of here.
"producer/worldc1m1b36.vcd",//Rochelle: I bet you're right.
"producer/worldc1m1b37.vcd",//Rochelle: So long as you're sure.
"producer/worldc1m1b38.vcd",//Rochelle: Sounds like you know what you're talking about. Let's go.
"producer/worldc1m1b39.vcd",//Rochelle: These… don't look like people.
"producer/worldc1m1b40.vcd",//Rochelle: Zombies. Holy shit. They're real.
"producer/worldc1m1b41.vcd",//Rochelle: You hear about them, but until you see them…
"producer/worldc1m1b42.vcd",//Rochelle: Holy shit, zombies. I saw the news reports… hell, I PRODUCED some, but… wow.
"producer/worldc1m1b43.vcd",//Rochelle: What the hell is this thing?
"producer/worldc1m1b44.vcd",//Rochelle: Okay, Rochelle. You just beat a zombie a death. Everything is… just fine.
"producer/worldc1m1b45.vcd",//Rochelle: All right. I just did that.
"producer/worldc1m1b46.vcd",//Rochelle: Okay. Now I'm killing zombies.
"producer/worldc1m1b47.vcd",//Rochelle: Yeah, yeah I can make sense of this. We are screwed.
"producer/worldc1m1b48.vcd",//Rochelle: I heard Atlanta already fell.
"producer/worldc1m1b49.vcd",//Rochelle: I work for a news station, we'd HEARD about the East Coast, but… Jesus. I didn't know it was this bad.
"producer/worldc1m1b50.vcd",//Rochelle: Hey, look at this map. We need to get to New Orleans, FAST.
"producer/worldc1m1b51.vcd",//Rochelle: New Orleans is all that's left.
"producer/worldc1m1b52.vcd",//Rochelle: Reports were really fragmented, CEDA never told anyone it was this bad.
"producer/worldc1m1b53.vcd",//Rochelle: I think CEDA should have been telling us do more than wash our hands.
"producer/worldc1m2b01.vcd",//Rochelle: A gun STORE? For the first time in my life, that sounds good.
"producer/worldc1m2b02.vcd",//Rochelle: A whole store full of guns? You're talking MY language, Coach.
"producer/worldc1m2b03.vcd",//Rochelle: A whole store? Full of guns? You are talking MY language, Ellis.
"producer/worldc1m2b04.vcd",//Rochelle: So long as there's zombies trying to kill me he is.
"producer/worldc1m2b05.vcd",//Rochelle: Well, no, not usually. But for now? Yes.
"producer/worldc1m2b06.vcd",//Rochelle: Eh, um not normally, it's complicated.
"producer/worldc1m2b07.vcd",//Rochelle: Okay, no, normally I hate guns. But I… think I hate zombies more.
"producer/worldc1m2b08.vcd",//Rochelle: Great, we're heading the right way to the mall.
"producer/worldc1m2b09.vcd",//Rochelle: Bridge to the mall's blocked! We need to find another way.
"producer/worldc1m2b10.vcd",//Rochelle: Let's try that door.
