"producer/worldc1m2b12.vcd",//Rochelle: Over the dumpster!
"producer/worldc1m2b13.vcd",//Rochelle: We have GOT to get over that bridge!
"producer/worldc1m2b14.vcd",//Rochelle: Okay, we've gotta be getting close to that mall!
"producer/worldc1m2b15.vcd",//Rochelle: This whole city looks abandoned.
"producer/worldc1m2b16.vcd",//Rochelle: CEDA'd better be at that mall…
"producer/worldc1m2b17.vcd",//Rochelle: So… many… guns.
"producer/worldc1m2b18.vcd",//Rochelle: Oh… my… GOD.
"producer/worldc1m2b19.vcd",//Rochelle: Oh sweet Jesus look at all of these guns.
"producer/worldc1m2b20.vcd",//Rochelle: I want them all. Seriously. I want every gun in this store.
"producer/worldc1m2b21.vcd",//Rochelle: Would you LOOK at all these guns?
"producer/worldc1m2b22.vcd",//Rochelle: Jeez, Ellis? Is it supposed to feel this good to see this many guns?
"producer/worldc1m2b23.vcd",//Rochelle: I regret every joke I ever made about gun owners.
"producer/worldc1m2b24.vcd",//Rochelle: I don't know if it's the feel, or the weight, or the thousand zombies trying to kill me. But I am really starting to like these guns.
"producer/worldc1m2b25.vcd",//Rochelle: Why didn't anyone TELL me shooting these things felt like this?
"producer/worldc1m2b26.vcd",//Rochelle: Oh, it feels so wrong, but is just so right. I love guns. There I said it. I love guns.
"producer/worldc1m2b27.vcd",//Rochelle: You're a nice one.
