"producer/worldc1m2b48.vcd",//Rochelle: *kkt* Headshot.
"producer/worldc1m2b49.vcd",//Rochelle: All other guns… bow before this gun.
"producer/worldc1m2b50.vcd",//Rochelle: Oh, this is my new favorite.
