"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting06.vcd",//Francis: Hey! Are you a racecar driver?
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting07.vcd",//Francis: Hey! Nice ride!
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting08.vcd",//Francis: Hey! Are you a racecar driver?
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting09.vcd",//Francis: Can't! Generator's out. Get to the other side and fill it up! We'll cover ya!
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting10.vcd",//Francis: Ma'am, uhh, miss? I'm sorry but I can't lower the bridge myself. If you can get to the other side I can help you lower it.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting11.vcd",//Francis: Ahh sorry, no, ma'am.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting12.vcd",//Francis: No, ma'am.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting13.vcd",//Francis: If I could, I would. Can't. Get to the other side and we can lower it together.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting14.vcd",//Francis: No, ma'am.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting15.vcd",//Francis: Uhhh yyyeaaah.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting16.vcd",//Francis: Yeah.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting17.vcd",//Francis: HELL YEAH!
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting18.vcd",//Francis: If you want to keep going this way, you're gonna have to walk to the other side of this bridge and then me and some other cops up here can help you lower the bridge.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting19.vcd",//Francis: You down there, be calm. We're cops.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting20.vcd",//Francis: Hey!
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting21.vcd",//Francis: I was talking to the little lady.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting22.vcd",//Francis: Ahh shit. Nooo. But if you can get to the other side we can help you lower it.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting23.vcd",//Francis: Go to hell, suit.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting24.vcd",//Francis: Bite me, Colonel Sanders.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting25.vcd",//Francis: Bite me, Colonel Sanders.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting26.vcd",//Francis: Hell yeah, I'll help *YOU*.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting27.vcd",//Francis: HEY!
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting28.vcd",//Francis: HEY!
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting29.vcd",//Francis: HEY! I heard that!
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting30.vcd",//Francis: Brother, that's what I'm trying to tell ya. We can't get this thing down ourselves. You have to get to the other side.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting31.vcd",//Francis: Is there anyone of you four who isn't an asshole?
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting32.vcd",//Francis: Look, I don't love this bridge. But we just lost a man and… Sorry brother, but you are on your own.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting33.vcd",//Francis: And I'm telling you, I can't lower the bridge. You gotta get around to the other side.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting34.vcd",//Francis: Brother, I don't love this bridge, but right now we just lost a man and got a man down. Sorry, you are on your own.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting35.vcd",//Francis: Okay! Bridge is down! That's as far as it goes.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting36.vcd",//Francis: Really, this is as far as it goes. Never saw it any lower.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting37.vcd",//Francis: Oh yeah... uh, yeah it is.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting38.vcd",//Francis: Kick ASS! Now all you gotta do is go back into town, find some way to cross the river, fight your way to the other side of this bridge, refuel the generator and get it back going. Then it's kissing time!
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting39.vcd",//Francis: Are any of you vampires?
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting40.vcd",//Francis: Sorry, can't.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting41.vcd",//Francis: Louis! I told you there were vampires!
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting42.vcd",//Francis: I'm not talking to any goddamn vampires.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting43.vcd",//Francis: Yeah! Yeah! That's what I've been saying.
"biker/dlc1_c6m1_initialmeeting44.vcd",//Francis: Sorry, brother. Like I've been telling you. This bridge is up until the generator gets refueled.
"biker/dlc1_c6m3_finalechat01.vcd",//Francis: Hello, Rochellllle. A beautiful name for a beautiful lady. This your dad?
"biker/dlc1_c6m3_finalechat02.vcd",//Francis: What's your name again?
