"biker/dlc1_c6m3_finalechat04.vcd",//Francis: Then...
"biker/dlc1_c6m3_finalechat05.vcd",//Francis: Oh yeah. Bill definitely woulda shot him.
"biker/dlc1_c6m3_finalechat06.vcd",//Francis: What's your name again?
"biker/dlc1_c6m3_finalechat07.vcd",//Francis: I'm Francis. You don't need to worry about him.
"biker/dlc1_c6m3_finalechat08.vcd",//Francis: I'm Francis. You don't need to worry about him. He'll probably be dead soon.
"biker/dlc1_c6m3_finalechat09.vcd",//Francis: Yeah, that's Louis. I wouldn't get too attached to him, he'll probably be dead soon. I'm Francis.
"biker/dlc1_c6m3_finalechat10.vcd",//Francis: So... you like vests?
"biker/dlc1_c6m3_finalechat11.vcd",//Francis: Oh my god. I HATE THOSE TOO! I HATE EM SO MUCH!
