"biker/dlc2canadahate01.vcd",//Francis: Oh my god, I hate Canada so much.
"biker/dlc2canadahate02.vcd",//Francis: If there's one thing I hate more than vampires, it's Canada.
"biker/dlc2canadaspecial01.vcd",//Francis: I HEAR A BOOMER! And it sounded Canadian!
"biker/dlc2canadaspecial02.vcd",//Francis: HUNTER! It looked Canadian!
"biker/dlc2container01.vcd",//Francis: Through this container!
"biker/dlc2forlease01.vcd",//Francis: 'For...lease.' Anybody got a pen? I wanna write this number down.
"biker/dlc2forlease02.vcd",//Francis: 'For...lease.'
"biker/dlc2gastanks01.vcd",//Francis: Hey, Zoey, look! We're 'passing gas'... [chuckles]
"biker/dlc2gastanks02.vcd",//Francis: Hey, Louis, look! We're 'passing gas'... [chuckles]
"biker/dlc2gastanks03.vcd",//Francis: Hey, Bill, look! We're 'passing gas'... [chuckles]
"biker/dlc2gastanks04.vcd",//Francis: Nice one.
"biker/dlc2genericresponses03.vcd",//Francis: Yer kidding, right?
"biker/dlc2hersch01.vcd",//Francis: I drove for Hersch once. Till some guy laughed at my little brown shorts. And I beat him to death.
"biker/dlc2incoming01.vcd",//Francis: Here they come! Zoey, just pretend they're all helicopter pilots!
"biker/dlc2intro01.vcd",//Francis: I still can't believe you shot the pilot!
"biker/dlc2intro02.vcd",//Francis: [pouty] Well, I guess NOW we'll never know, will we?
"biker/dlc2intro03.vcd",//Francis: Or, in this case, a vampire.
"biker/dlc2intro04.vcd",//Francis: [confused] Wait, WHAT happened?
"biker/dlc2intro05.vcd",//Francis: See? I TOLD ya. Helicopter crashed. We're not saved, we're all gonna die. Pay up.
"biker/dlc2intro06.vcd",//Francis: 'Cause it's money in the bank. Remind me to explain gambling to you sometime.
"biker/dlc2intro07.vcd",//Francis: Hey. Sunshine Beams. We just CRASHED. You got somethin' positive to say about that?
"biker/dlc2intro08.vcd",//Francis: Alright. I'll give ya that.
"biker/dlc2intro09.vcd",//Francis: Hey. Sunshine Beams. We just CRASHED. You got somethin' positive to say about that?
"biker/dlc2intro10.vcd",//Francis: Is that how helicopters are supposed to land?
"biker/dlc2intro11.vcd",//Francis: That's what I thought...
"biker/dlc2intro12.vcd",//Francis: Yeah, well--Next time someone offers us a ride, don't SHOOT him.
"biker/dlc2intro13.vcd",//Francis: Hey Louis. That fancy college of yours teach ya how to fix a helicopter?
"biker/dlc2intro14.vcd",//Francis: Terrific. Looks like we're walkin, then.
"biker/dlc2intro15.vcd",//Francis: Goddamnit, where'd they buy this helicopter? At the ... uh... um... hold on...
"biker/dlc2intro16.vcd",//Francis: Yeah! Stupid helicopter.
"biker/dlc2intro17.vcd",//Francis: I ever tell you how I feel about helicopters?
"biker/dlc2intro18.vcd",//Francis: I guess I DID tell ya.
"biker/dlc2intro19.vcd",//Francis: Guys. Everyone. I wanna say something: I. hate. helicopters.
"biker/dlc2intro20.vcd",//Francis: [sincere] Wow! I love helicopters! I love 'em so much.
"biker/dlc2intro21.vcd",//Francis: Whoah. Musta hit my head in the crash. I'm okay now. I hate helicopters.
"biker/dlc2intro22.vcd",//Francis: I hate walking.
"biker/dlc2intro23.vcd",//Francis: And it turns out I was right about that.
"biker/dlc2intro24.vcd",//Francis: Alright, nobody panic. I have a plan.
"biker/dlc2intro25.vcd",//Francis: Well, it's pretty complicated. I don't wanna bore you with a lotta... complex... fractions. But step one is we walk THAT way.
"biker/dlc2intro26.vcd",//Francis: You still wearin' that tie, Louis? What, you got a meeting? Bah ha ha.
"biker/dlc2intro27.vcd",//Francis: [grumbling under breath]...Don't see what's wrong with vests...
"biker/dlc2intro28.vcd",//Francis: [grumbling under breath]... Not even WEARIN' chaps...
"biker/dlc2intro29.vcd",//Francis: [grumbling under breath]... I HATE parades.
"biker/dlc2intro30.vcd",//Francis: Let's just hike the hell out of here.
"biker/dlc2intro31.vcd",//Francis: Looks like we're walking again.
"biker/dlc2intro32.vcd",//Francis: I hate helicopters.
"biker/dlc2m1directional01.vcd",//Francis: Let's go left.
"biker/dlc2m1directional02.vcd",//Francis: Truck's blocking the whole goddamn road...
"biker/dlc2m1directional03.vcd",//Francis: There's the bridge!
"biker/dlc2m1directional04.vcd",//Francis: Come on, let's get to the bridge.
