"biker/dlc2m1directional06.vcd",//Francis: Get to the bridge!
"biker/dlc2m1directional07.vcd",//Francis: We can get back up over here!
"biker/dlc2m1directional08.vcd",//Francis: Ah hell, the bridge is blocked.
