"biker/dlc2m1directional12.vcd",//Francis: Into the warehouse!
"biker/dlc2m1goal01.vcd",//Francis: I already hate this place. Let's get outta here.
"biker/dlc2m1goal02.vcd",//Francis: Let's follow that bridge. Might be a way outta this dump.
"biker/dlc2m1goal03.vcd",//Francis: Riverside! Ain't that where the army's holed up?
"biker/dlc2m1gunend01.vcd",//Francis: Fire's out.
"biker/dlc2m1gunend02.vcd",//Francis: Everybody across the bridge!
