"biker/dlc2m2directional02.vcd",//Francis: Up that fence!
"biker/dlc2m2directional03.vcd",//Francis: Over that truck!
"biker/dlc2m2directional04.vcd",//Francis: Let's get in that truck, step on the gas, and not stop till we see the army.
"biker/dlc2m2directional05.vcd",//Francis: I got an idea. Let's steal that truck.
