"namvet/c6dlc3firsteventover07.vcd",//Bill: It's dying down. Two more.
"namvet/c6dlc3firstsaferoom01.vcd",//Bill: Zoey. I know you're mad at me.
"namvet/c6dlc3firstsaferoom02.vcd",//Bill: Zoey. Listen. The four of us are all that matters now.
"namvet/c6dlc3firstsaferoom03.vcd",//Bill: I keep telling you: we're looking for a sail boat.
"namvet/c6dlc3firstsaferoom04.vcd",//Bill: Shut up, Franc-- alright, that's not a bad idea.
"namvet/c6dlc3firstsaferoom05.vcd",//Bill: Shut up, Franc-- alright, that's not a bad idea.
"namvet/c6dlc3firstsaferoom06.vcd",//Bill: Dammit, Zoey! We trusted CEDA! We trusted the military! And they left us to die! Do you think they'll ever let us back in? We're on our own, kid. It's high time you started actin' like it.
"namvet/c6dlc3firstsaferoom07.vcd",//Bill: We'll find it, we'll find it.
"namvet/c6dlc3francisdies01.vcd",//Bill: Francis! No! NO!
"namvet/c6dlc3francisdies02.vcd",//Bill: Francis, you beautiful son of a bitch you did it!
"namvet/c6dlc3francisdies03.vcd",//Bill: Francis, I will not forget you.
"namvet/c6dlc3francisdies04.vcd",//Bill: Francis, I will not forget this.
"namvet/c6dlc3generic01.vcd",//Bill: Over the ship!
"namvet/c6dlc3generic02.vcd",//Bill: Across the ship!
"namvet/c6dlc3generic03.vcd",//Bill: Down the loader.
"namvet/c6dlc3generic04.vcd",//Bill: Up the hill!
