"namvet/c6dlc3generic06.vcd",//Bill: Past the bricks.
"namvet/c6dlc3generic07.vcd",//Bill: Under the bridge.
"namvet/c6dlc3gravelhill01.vcd",//Bill: Goddamn pile of rocks.
"namvet/c6dlc3gravelhill02.vcd",//Bill: Don't give up on me, keep going!
"namvet/c6dlc3gravelhill03.vcd",//Bill: Goddamn it... crows!
"namvet/c6dlc3gravelhill04.vcd",//Bill: Horseshit goddamn birds...
"namvet/c6dlc3gravelhill05.vcd",//Bill: Shut-up you goddamn birds!
"namvet/c6dlc3gravelhill06.vcd",//Bill: Get into that chute!
"namvet/c6dlc3gravelhill07.vcd",//Bill: Everyone into the chute!
"namvet/c6dlc3gravelhill08.vcd",//Bill: Double time up the hill!
"namvet/c6dlc3harborblocked01.vcd",//Bill: Have to find a boat on the other side of this bridge.
"namvet/c6dlc3harborblocked02.vcd",//Bill: That bridge is blocking the harbor.
"namvet/c6dlc3harborblocked03.vcd",//Bill: Let's head down river to find the boat.
"namvet/c6dlc3harborblocked04.vcd",//Bill: Let's follow the river.
"namvet/c6dlc3harborblocked05.vcd",//Bill: LOUIS, the ocean doesn't flow into the river.
"namvet/c6dlc3hittingbridgebutton01.vcd",//Bill: We gotta hit the the button to raise the bridge.
"namvet/c6dlc3hittingbridgebutton02.vcd",//Bill: Raise the bridge! Hit the button!
"namvet/c6dlc3hittingbridgebutton03.vcd",//Bill: We gotta all get on and hit that button.
"namvet/c6dlc3intanktraincar01.vcd",//Bill: This is not pretty.
"namvet/c6dlc3intanktraincar02.vcd",//Bill: Can't believe this car held that thing.
"namvet/c6dlc3intanktraincar03.vcd",//Bill: Stinks like shit in here.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro01.vcd",//Bill: End of the line, people!
"namvet/c6dlc3intro02.vcd",//Bill: Shut up, Francis.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro03.vcd",//Bill: Alright, let's move! No stragglers!
"namvet/c6dlc3intro04.vcd",//Bill: Alright, let's move! Everyone stay together!
"namvet/c6dlc3intro05.vcd",//Bill: Nope. Gotta be a sail boat.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro06.vcd",//Bill: I ain't stoppin' the boat every 15 minutes to go look for gas.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro07.vcd",//Bill: Alright, everybody, remember: we're lookin' for a sail boat.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro08.vcd",//Bill: 'Cause we ain't stoppin' for gas.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro09.vcd",//Bill: You know who runs around filling up things with gas? Idiots.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro10.vcd",//Bill: Alright, everybody, remember: we're lookin' for a sail boat. I aim to get to the Keys, and I ain't stoppin' for gas.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro11.vcd",//Bill: We gotta find a sail boat.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro12.vcd",//Bill: That's not a sailboat.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro13.vcd",//Bill: And it's on fire.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro14.vcd",//Bill: That's not a sailboat. And it's on fire.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro15.vcd",//Bill: We're out of track.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro16.vcd",//Bill: Shut up, Francis.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro17.vcd",//Bill: Both of you shut up.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro18.vcd",//Bill: Zoey, I need you to trust me on this.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro19.vcd",//Bill: Zoey, we're together and on our own.  That's what's important.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro20.vcd",//Bill: Zoey, we all made it together.  That was my plan.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro21.vcd",//Bill: Zoey, we all made this far together.  That was my plan.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro22.vcd",//Bill: Zoey. You ready to head for the Keys?
"namvet/c6dlc3intro23.vcd",//Bill: Train ride's over, you gotta focus.  This isn't gonna be easy.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro24.vcd",//Bill: Pull yourself together, if not for me then for them.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro25.vcd",//Bill: Zoey. You ready to head to the Keys?
"namvet/c6dlc3intro26.vcd",//Bill: Zoey. You still mad?
"namvet/c6dlc3intro27.vcd",//Bill: Come on, let's move.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro28.vcd",//Bill: Shut your traps, let's move out.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro29.vcd",//Bill: I'll give you something to cry about, Francis.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro30.vcd",//Bill: Zoey... Christ, kid. We come back for our own.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro31.vcd",//Bill: You ever get tired of being an idiot, Francis?
"namvet/c6dlc3intro32.vcd",//Bill: Zoey... No one here is being left behind..
"namvet/c6dlc3intro33.vcd",//Bill: End of the line. Let's move.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro34.vcd",//Bill: I can go find a boat on my own, Francis. Why don't you go back in the train car, shut your little eyes and have a good cry?
"namvet/c6dlc3intro35.vcd",//Bill: You gettin' tired, Francis? Tell you what: I'll go find us a boat. Then I'll come back, pick you up and carry you there.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro36.vcd",//Bill: Almost there, people! We just gotta find a boat and we'll be in the Keys.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro37.vcd",//Bill: That's as far as the train's taking us. If we're gonna get to the Keys, we'll need a boat.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro38.vcd",//Bill: If we stayed, no one would have escaped.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro39.vcd",//Bill: Zoey.  I can't.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro40.vcd",//Bill: Let's find a boat that can make it to the Gulf.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro41.vcd",//Bill: Francis, you'd have been walking the plank right now.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro42.vcd",//Bill: It'll do you good son.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro43.vcd",//Bill: End of the line sweeties.  Grab some gear and let's go.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro44.vcd",//Bill: Zoey...  I'm not leaving any of you behind.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro45.vcd",//Bill: You're a regular health nut.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro46.vcd",//Bill: The train rides over, time to get back to walking.
"namvet/c6dlc3intro47.vcd",//Bill: Out here, they're immune, dead or zombies.
"namvet/c6dlc3jumpingoffbridge01.vcd",//Bill: Stay there, I got it.
"namvet/c6dlc3jumpingoffbridge02.vcd",//Bill: Don't get off the bridge, I have this.
"namvet/c6dlc3jumpingoffbridge03.vcd",//Bill: Stay there! I got this!
"namvet/c6dlc3jumpingoffbridge04.vcd",//Bill: You take care.
"namvet/c6dlc3jumpingoffbridge05.vcd",//Bill: Remember: Stay together! No matter what!
"namvet/c6dlc3jumpingoffbridge06.vcd",//Bill: Do not follow me!
"namvet/c6dlc3jumpingoffbridge07.vcd",//Bill: Nobody try to help me! I'm doing this alone!
"namvet/c6dlc3jumpingoffbridge08.vcd",//Bill: I'm not horseshittin' around, don't follow me!
"namvet/c6dlc3jumpingoffbridge09.vcd",//Bill: Take care of each other!
"namvet/c6dlc3jumpingoffbridge10.vcd",//Bill: Be safe! Get to the Keys!
"namvet/c6dlc3jumpingoffbridge11.vcd",//Bill: You guys mean everything to me! Stay there!
"namvet/c6dlc3jumpingoffbridge12.vcd",//Bill: You guys are the only family I got! Take care of each other!
"namvet/c6dlc3jumpingoffbridge13.vcd",//Bill: Stay on the goddamn bridge, I have this.
"namvet/c6dlc3jumpingoffbridge14.vcd",//Bill: No matter what happens: stay together.
"namvet/c6dlc3louisdies01.vcd",//Bill: LOOOOUUUIISSSS!!!
"namvet/c6dlc3louisdies02.vcd",//Bill: Louis, you did it, you did it.
"namvet/c6dlc3louisdies03.vcd",//Bill: Louis, Louis, goddamnit Louis!!
"namvet/c6dlc3louisdies04.vcd",//Bill: Louis, you weren't supposed to die.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline01.vcd",//Bill: My job's done.  Have at me you bastards!
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline02.vcd",//Bill: My job's done. Let's see what you got, you big dumb sons of bitches.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline03.vcd",//Bill: My friends are safe, there's nothing you bastards can do to me now!
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline04.vcd",//Bill: You monkeys ain't gonna spoil this.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline05.vcd",//Bill: You shoulda brought more tanks with you.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline06.vcd",//Bill: You're too late. They're safe.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline07.vcd",//Bill: You sons of bitches took everything. But you ain't takin' them.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline08.vcd",//Bill: You're too late.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline09.vcd",//Bill: I'm ready.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline10.vcd",//Bill: I'll see peace back on Earth… if I gotta murder every one of you bastards…. with my bare goddamn hands.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline11.vcd",//Bill: Awwww, horseshit.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline12.vcd",//Bill: You want me, come and get it. I'm just scars and tar anyway. But you didn't get them--did you, you sons of bitches?
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline13.vcd",//Bill: Guess you can't unmake how things end up. None of it. This is all just how it is. But you never got them, did you? They're safe. So that's just fine.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline14.vcd",//Bill: I gotta admit... this ain't how I pictured it. Good enough. Good enough.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline15.vcd",//Bill: I gotta admit... this ain't how I pictured it. Good enough.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline16.vcd",//Bill: I had a good run. Knowing they're safe, I wouldn't have changed a thing.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline17.vcd",//Bill: I had a good run. I wouldn't have changed a thing.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline18.vcd",//Bill: That felt like no time at all.
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline19.vcd",//Bill: That all you brought?
"namvet/c6dlc3movieline20.vcd",//Bill: If I'd known how many of you sonsabitches there were when we started out--guess I woulda saved the shoe leather and fought you there.
"namvet/c6dlc3onbigship01.vcd",//Bill: Don't get pulled off the port side.
"namvet/c6dlc3onbigship02.vcd",//Bill: Run to the bow.
"namvet/c6dlc3onbigship03.vcd",//Bill: We got stuff in the hold.
"namvet/c6dlc3onbigship04.vcd",//Bill: There's supplies in the hold!
"namvet/c6dlc3openingdoor01.vcd",//Bill: When this door opens, light the mother up.
"namvet/c6dlc3openingdoor02.vcd",//Bill: Get ready, I'm opening the door.
"namvet/c6dlc3openingdoor03.vcd",//Bill: Stand back and get ready.
"namvet/c6dlc3openingdoor04.vcd",//Bill: Door's opening up!
"namvet/c6dlc3otherboats01.vcd",//Bill: Sail boat, Francis.
"namvet/c6dlc3otherboats02.vcd",//Bill: Sail boat, Francis. Sailboat.
"namvet/c6dlc3otherboats03.vcd",//Bill: No Francis.
"namvet/c6dlc3otherboats04.vcd",//Bill: Francis, does it have a sail?
