"namvet/c6dlc3otherboats06.vcd",//Bill: Francis, that's a car.
"namvet/c6dlc3otherboats07.vcd",//Bill: Francis, that boat's underwater.
"namvet/c6dlc3otherboats08.vcd",//Bill: Francis, one that's isn't on fire.
"namvet/c6dlc3otherboats09.vcd",//Bill: Son, that's a trailer and you're an idiot.
"namvet/c6dlc3prestart1stgen01.vcd",//Bill: Careful with these generators, they're gonna attract hordes!
"namvet/c6dlc3prestart1stgen02.vcd",//Bill: We gotta start these generators.
"namvet/c6dlc3prestart1stgen03.vcd",//Bill: If we power these generators we can raise that bridge.
"namvet/c6dlc3prestart1stgen04.vcd",//Bill: These generators must be setup to power the bridge.
"namvet/c6dlc3prestart1stgen05.vcd",//Bill: First one, everyone ready?
"namvet/c6dlc3prestart1stgen06.vcd",//Bill: Get ready, this things  gonna make a racket.
"namvet/c6dlc3prestart2ndgen01.vcd",//Bill: Let's power up this generator.
"namvet/c6dlc3prestart2ndgen02.vcd",//Bill: Let's do this better than the last one.
"namvet/c6dlc3prestart2ndgen03.vcd",//Bill: Let's get prepared before we start it.
"namvet/c6dlc3prestart2ndgen04.vcd",//Bill: If we're ready let's hit it.
"namvet/c6dlc3prestartlastgen01.vcd",//Bill: Get ready, let's do this.
"namvet/c6dlc3prestartlastgen02.vcd",//Bill: Last one, let's be careful.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondeventover01.vcd",//Bill: Way to go people, to the last generator.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondeventover02.vcd",//Bill: Let's move out!
"namvet/c6dlc3secondeventover03.vcd",//Bill: To the last generator!
"namvet/c6dlc3secondeventover04.vcd",//Bill: To the last gennie.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondsaferoom01.vcd",//Bill: Bah. Keep your computers, emails... whatever. Just give me a pen and paper.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondsaferoom02.vcd",//Bill: NOOOO!
"namvet/c6dlc3secondsaferoom03.vcd",//Bill: They didn't have electricity when I was born.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondsaferoom04.vcd",//Bill: No! They hadn't even invented the wheel when I was born.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondsaferoom05.vcd",//Bill: Not far at all. We find an island, make it ours. No more army, no more CEDA, no more horseshit.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondsaferoom06.vcd",//Bill: We have to be getting close.  Once we're on the boat, we're home free.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondsaferoom07.vcd",//Bill: Unless you're gonna stop eating, we're gonna need a damn big boat to hold all the supplies.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondsaferoom08.vcd",//Bill: Yeah. A couple of 'em. We get there in one piece, we're gonna clear the island and spend the rest of our lives relaxing on the beach.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondsaferoom09.vcd",//Bill: Damn right I know how to fish, kid.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondsaferoom10.vcd",//Bill: Tell you what: Once we clear the island and settle in, I'll make you a pro.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondsaferoom11.vcd",//Bill: Allright, people. There's gotta be a sailboat around here somewhere. We're gonna find it, get to the keys, and build ourselves a little piece of paradise.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondsaferoom12.vcd",//Bill: Cut the horseshit, Francis.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondsaferoom13.vcd",//Bill: They're defensible, Francis. Far as we know, zombies can't swim.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondsaferoom14.vcd",//Bill: Speak up, son.
"namvet/c6dlc3secondsaferoom15.vcd",//Bill: Noted. Let's go.
"namvet/c6dlc3seeingbigship01.vcd",//Bill: No Francis, we can't.
"namvet/c6dlc3seeingbigship02.vcd",//Bill: You know how to pilot this thing, Francis?
"namvet/c6dlc3spottingsailboat01.vcd",//Bill: Christ, bridge is in the way. We'll need to raise it.
"namvet/c6dlc3spottingsailboat02.vcd",//Bill: If we wanna take that boat down river, we'll need to raise that bridge.
"namvet/c6dlc3spottingsailboat03.vcd",//Bill: There's a sailboat by the bridge! We can take that.
"namvet/c6dlc3spottingsailboat04.vcd",//Bill: There's a sailboat on the wrong side of the bridge. We can raise the bridge and go!
"namvet/c6dlc3spottingsailboat05.vcd",//Bill: If we raise that bridge, we can use that sailboat.
"namvet/c6dlc3startinggenerators01.vcd",//Bill: Come on, damn you.
"namvet/c6dlc3startinggenerators02.vcd",//Bill: Start already.
"namvet/c6dlc3startinggenerators03.vcd",//Bill: Let's go!
"namvet/c6dlc3startinggenerators04.vcd",//Bill: Come on, come on, come on.
"namvet/c6dlc3startinggenerators05.vcd",//Bill: Jesus Mary and Joseph, start already.
"namvet/c6dlc3startinggenerators06.vcd",//Bill: Let's go! Let's go!
"namvet/c6dlc3startinggenerators07.vcd",//Bill: Catch, catch you son of a bitch.
"namvet/c6dlc3tankintrainyard01.vcd",//Bill: Goddamn it.  Only the military would think putting a tank in a train was a good idea.
"namvet/c6dlc3tankintrainyard02.vcd",//Bill: Careful opening that door, he sounds frisky.
"namvet/c6dlc3tankintrainyard03.vcd",//Bill: Get ready. Let's set a trap for this son of a bitch.
"namvet/c6dlc3zoeydies01.vcd",//Bill: Damn it, kid.  NOOOOOOO!
"namvet/c6dlc3zoeydies02.vcd",//Bill: ZOEY!!! It wasn't supposed to be you!
"namvet/c6dlc3zoeydies03.vcd",//Bill: NO, NO, NOT ZOEY!
"namvet/c6dlc3zoeydies04.vcd",//Bill: ZOOOOOOEEEEEYYYY!!!!
"namvet/c6dlc3zoeydies05.vcd",//Bill: ZOEY! You did it!
"namvet/c6dlc3zoeydies06.vcd",//Bill: Zoey! It wasn't supposed to end like this.
