"namvet/gamespeech01.vcd",//Bill: I'll see peace back on earth if I gotta murder every one of these animals with my own bare hands.
"namvet/generic03.vcd",//Bill: Francis, is there anything you don't hate?
"namvet/generic14.vcd",//Bill: Don't be an ass, Francis.
"namvet/generic22.vcd",//Bill: Close your mouth and open your eyes, Francis. You'll aim better.
