"namvet/generic24.vcd",//Bill: You know who's gonna survive this mess, Francis? It ain't the fella makin' jokes.
"namvet/generic27.vcd",//Bill: Speak up, Francis. Your voice got all muffled from yer head being so far up yer ass.
"namvet/generic29.vcd",//Bill: I'll see peace back on earth if I gotta murder every one of these bastards with my bare goddamn hands.
"namvet/generic32.vcd",//Bill: Damn straight.
"namvet/generic33.vcd",//Bill: We been immune so far, but - well, if I start to turn, promise you'll shoot me.
"namvet/generic34.vcd",//Bill: Even bein' in a war doesn't prepare you for this. They never stop. They come at you and come at you and they *never* goddamn *stop*.
