"teengirl/dlc1_c6m3_finalechat02.vcd",//Zoey: Yeah, sorry about that.
"teengirl/dlc1_c6m3_finalechat03.vcd",//Zoey: Yeah, sorry about that.
"teengirl/dlc1_c6m3_finalechat04.vcd",//Zoey: Fine. Look, uh you guys need to go down there and fill up the generator so we can lower the bridge.
