"teengirl/revivecriticalfriend01.vcd",//Zoey: It's all right - I gotcha. Boy we need to find you some first aid. If you go down like this again, that's it for you.
"teengirl/revivecriticalfriend02.vcd",//Zoey: You're going to be okay, I can get you back up, but we need to find you some first aid. If you go down like this again, that's it for you.
"teengirl/revivecriticalfriend03.vcd",//Zoey: Don't worry, don't worry, I can help.  But we need to find you some first aid. If you go down like this again, that's it for you.
"teengirl/revivecriticalfriend04.vcd",//Zoey: I'm here. I'll help you. We need to find you some first aid. If you go down like this again, that's it for you.
"teengirl/revivecriticalfriend05.vcd",//Zoey: Let me help you up. We really need to find you some first aid. If you go down like this again, that's it for you.
"teengirl/revivecriticalfriend06.vcd",//Zoey: Okay, I think I can get you back on your feet, but we need to find you some first aid. If you go down like this again, that's it for you.
"teengirl/revivecriticalfriend07.vcd",//Zoey: Let me help you.  You should be okay for a little bit, but we need to find you some first aid. If you go down like this again, that's it for you.
"teengirl/revivefriend01.vcd",//Zoey: Hang on. It's all right. I gotcha. Now get up - we gotta move.
"teengirl/revivefriend03.vcd",//Zoey: This isn't it for you yet.  C'mon, up and at 'em. We gotta keep moving.
"teengirl/revivefriend04.vcd",//Zoey: I have you. Lie still and let me help.  We gotta get you back on your feet. Okay, up we go.
"teengirl/revivefriend06.vcd",//Zoey: I gotcha - I was worried there.  Now get up, come on. We gotta keep moving.
"teengirl/revivefriend08.vcd",//Zoey: This looks bad, but I can get you back up.  Get you moving again.
